BlankingSourceFaultLine5|Blanking Source Type|||||the fault inputs can be temporarily disabled to blank spurious fault events. Specifies the type of blanking source
BlankingSourceFaultLine6|Blanking Source Type|||||the fault inputs can be temporarily disabled to blank spurious fault events. Specifies the type of blanking source
postscaler|Post scaler|||0x0|0xFFFFF|Ability to emit an ADC trigger only once per x pulses of the source event (x= post scaler + 1)
Ferom_TA|Roll-Over Event generation to be used by Fault/Event counters|Time Base Setting||||This bit defines when the roll-over is generated, in up-down counting mode. It only concerns the Rollover event used by the fault and event counters
Bmrom_TA|Roll-Over Event generation to be used by the Burst Mode Controller|Time Base Setting||||This bit defines when the roll-over is generated, in up-down counting mode. t only concerns the rollover event used in the burst mode controller, as clock as burst mode trigger.
Adrom_TA|Roll-Over Event generation to be used by ADC Trig|Time Base Setting||||This bit defines when the roll-over is generated, in up-down counting mode. It only concerns the rollover event which triggers the ADC.
Outrom_TA|Roll-Over Event generation to be used by Set/Reset Output circuitry|Time Base Setting||||This bit defines when the roll-over is generated, in up-down counting mode. it only concerns the rollover event which sets and/or resets the ouputs
rom_TA|Roll-Over Event generation to be used by Update Trigger, IRQ, DMA ,EEvent filtering, Repetion Counter decrement|Time Base Setting||||This bit defines when the roll-over is generated, in up-down counting mode. It only concerns the rollover event with the following destinations: update trigger (to transfer content from preload to active registers), IRQ and DMA requests, repetition counter decrement and external event filtering.
