StartOnSync|HRTIM_SYNCSTART_ENABLED|Synchronization input event starts the timer
ResetOnSync|HRTIM_SYNCRESET_DISABLED|Synchronization input event has no effect on the timer
ResetOnSync|HRTIM_SYNCRESET_ENABLED|Synchronization input event resets the timer
DACSynchro|HRTIM_DACSYNC_NONE|No DAC synchronization event generated
DACSynchro|HRTIM_DACSYNC_DACTRIGOUT_1|DAC synchronization event generated on DACTrigOut1 output upon timer update
