DACSynchro|HRTIM_DACSYNC_DACTRIGOUT_3|DAC update generated on DACTrigOut3 output upon timer update
PreloadEnable|HRTIM_PRELOAD_DISABLED|Preload disabled: the write access is directly done into the active register
PreloadEnable|HRTIM_PRELOAD_ENABLED|Preload enabled: the write access is done into the preload register
UpdateGating_MASTER|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_INDEPENDENT|Update done independently from the DMA burst transfer completion
UpdateGating_MASTER|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_DMABURST|Update done when the DMA burst transfer is completed
