UpdateGating_TA|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_INDEPENDENT|Update done independently from the DMA burst transfer completion
UpdateGating_TA|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_DMABURST|Update done when the DMA burst transfer is completed
UpdateGating_TA|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_DMABURST_UPDATE|Update done on timer roll-over following a DMA burst transfer completion
UpdateGating_TA|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_UPDEN1|Slave timer only - Update done on a rising edge of HRTIM update enable input 1
UpdateGating_TA|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_UPDEN2|Slave timer only - Update done on a rising edge of HRTIM update enable input 2
UpdateGating_TA|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_UPDEN3|Slave timer only - Update done on a rising edge of HRTIM update enable input 3
UpdateGating_TA|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_UPDEN1_UPDATE|Slave timer only - Update done on the update event following a rising edge of HRTIM update enable input 1
