UpdateGating_TA|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_UPDEN3_UPDATE|Slave timer only - Update done on the update event following a rising edge of HRTIM update enable input 3
UpdateGating_TB|HRTIM_UPDATEGATING_INDEPENDENT|Update done independently from the DMA burst transfer completion
